1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Frederik Vilhelm Herman Treschow [Parents] was born on 19 Feb 1895 in Sannarp Slott, Aarstad, Halland, Sverige. He married Hèlène baronesse von Buxhoeveden on 26 Oct 1932 in Storkyrkan, Stockholm. Frederik was empl
2 CONC oyed as Godsinspektør i Sperlingsholm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hèlène baronesse von Buxhoeveden [Parents] was born on 8 Apr 1907 in St. Petersburg, Russia. She married Frederik Vilhelm Herman Treschow on 26 Oct 1932 in Storkyrkan, Stockholm. 
