2 CONT *l* 1858. Ditlev Carl Hoskjær, f. l8 /io 11 Nøjsomhed, Brahetrolleborg S., F. Hans Jac. H. Kapt. i Vejkorpset, M. Cathr. http://archive.org/stream/danmarksprstehi00elvigoog/danmarksprstehi00elvigoog_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT Ditlev Hoskiær [Parents] was born in 1812. He died in 1896. He married Augusta Rasmussen in 1844. Ditlev was employed as Cand.theol., Sognepræst til Jordløse og Kalundborg.
