1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Magdalene Johnsen=
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Informasjon (Information)==
2 CONT
2 CONT >* Utvandret til USA med skibet Heimdal i 1883 sammen med sine barn Maren og Jacob
2 CONT >*  2 Feb 1893 Crayling, Crawford Co., MI Newspaper Avalanche: We wish to extend our sincere thanks to our friends and neighbors who kindly extended their aid and sympathy during the illness and final obsequies of our dear mother,
2 CONC  and also to Rev. TAYLOR, for courtesies extended. - John ROSENKILDE. Jacob ROSENKILDE, Mr. HENDRICKSON and Mrs. PETERSON.
2 CONT >* Died at the residence of her son in this village, Friday, January 20th, Magdalena ROSENKILDE, aged 74 years.
2 CONT >* The funeral services were conducted by Rev. A. GOTHE, of Manistee, at the M. E. church, assisted by Rev. S. G. TAYLOR, and were largely attended. (26 Jan 1893)
2 CONT
