1 NAME Ole Henrik /Stampe/
2 GIVN Ole Henrik
2 SURN Stampe
2 _MARNM Stampe
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1791
2 PLAC Skjørringe, Falkerslev, Maribo
